Error [jet.SharedReferenceCycle]: This write can close a strong `Shared` cycle through `Person`
  --> tests/ui/shared_strong_cycle_push.jet:10:5
    |
 10 |     kid.kids.push(mum.copy())
    |     ^^^^^^^^
 Why: The stored value may already reach this `Person` cell through strong `Shared` handles, and reference counting never frees a strong cycle
 Fix: Store a `Shared.Weak<Person>` back-edge (`.downgrade()`) or an id, or build the stored value here from new cells (`Shared{Person{…}}`)
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0221
